## 3. Where the city-capacity check happens (hard reject at 50)

`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/OwnerRestControllerV1.java`, method `addOwner(OwnerFieldsDto)` (lines 194-244). The relevant check, lines 230-233:

```java
long cityOwnerCount = clinicService.countOwnersByCity(owner.getCity());
if (cityOwnerCount >= CityOwnerLimitException.MAX_OWNERS_PER_CITY) {
